(319493, 24176, 4285, '<td valign="top">The blue and the silver go very well together.  However you can see that the surface is not entirely clean. A more diffused lighting setup would have made the picture much stronger. Also if you had cropped a little differently. Maybe if the ball end of the letter opener was approx. the same distance from the bottom as it is from the side. 6</td>', 'The blue and the silver go very well together.  However you can see that the surface is not entirely clean. A more diffused lighting setup would have made the picture much stronger. Also if you had cropped a little differently. Maybe if the ball end of the letter opener was approx. the same distance from the bottom as it is from the side. 6', '2003-06-09 08:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(319496, 24252, 4285, '<td valign="top">If you had cropped this in tighter, portrait style (long side up and down), it would have been a much stronger image. Too much yellow and red takes away from your subject. 5</td>', 'If you had cropped this in tighter, portrait style (long side up and down), it would have been a much stronger image. Too much yellow and red takes away from your subject. 5', '2003-06-09 08:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
