(319505, 24272, 8533, '<td valign="top">Not sure what is going on here but it results in a distorted blurred image that it hurts my eyes to look at.</td>', 'Not sure what is going on here but it results in a distorted blurred image that it hurts my eyes to look at.', '2003-06-09 09:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(319507, 24260, 8533, '<td valign="top">These look like bottle tops - how do they represent offices? Too little of the image is in focus for my liking.</td>', 'These look like bottle tops - how do they represent offices? Too little of the image is in focus for my liking.', '2003-06-09 09:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(319508, 23645, 8533, '<td valign="top">I can see you''ve carefully put this together but it doesn''t work very well as a concept for me - looks too staged as the staples are clearly all unused. Can''t quite put my finger on how it seems wrong but sorry, doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'I can see you''ve carefully put this together but it doesn''t work very well as a concept for me - looks too staged as the staples are clearly all unused. Can''t quite put my finger on how it seems wrong but sorry, doesn''t work for me.', '2003-06-09 09:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(319509, 24239, 8533, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what that is but I''m fairly sure I never saw one in an office. It''s lit rather brightly and doesn''t grab me as an interesting image.</td>', 'I don''t know what that is but I''m fairly sure I never saw one in an office. It''s lit rather brightly and doesn''t grab me as an interesting image.', '2003-06-09 09:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
