(319594, 24266, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great twist on the challenge!  Not sure whether I would have liked this better in color, but it is a fun shot -- great job getting the surfer well-positioned in the shot, and good job of not having your equipment stolen :)</td>', 'Great twist on the challenge!  Not sure whether I would have liked this better in color, but it is a fun shot -- great job getting the surfer well-positioned in the shot, and good job of not having your equipment stolen :)', '2003-06-09 12:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
