(319602, 24001, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this just doesn''t work for me in general... sorry... The shot is just too cluttered (granted, intentionally), and the reverse effect just isn''t flattering.  Sorry to be rather harsh on this one...</td>', 'I''m afraid this just doesn''t work for me in general... sorry... The shot is just too cluttered (granted, intentionally), and the reverse effect just isn''t flattering.  Sorry to be rather harsh on this one...', '2003-06-09 12:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
