(319641, 24202, 2764, '<td valign="top">I like verything but the crop - becasue the left top is cut it looks like the image needs to be rotated one degree.  And I wonder if it would look better with a square format rather than rectangular since you have centered the image - 8</td>', 'I like verything but the crop - becasue the left top is cut it looks like the image needs to be rotated one degree.  And I wonder if it would look better with a square format rather than rectangular since you have centered the image - 8', '2003-06-09 12:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(319642, 24143, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice choice... I''d be interested to find out whether it is a black and white shot or just the black chair and white painted wall which meant it didnt need a conversion. Nice picture. Mitonski</td>', 'Nice choice... I''d be interested to find out whether it is a black and white shot or just the black chair and white painted wall which meant it didnt need a conversion. Nice picture. Mitonski', '2003-06-09 12:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
