(319679, 24268, 5391, '<td valign="top">I positively love abstract work and I think that you''ve "seen" this in a brilliant way and captured it well.  I love the monochrome feel, the way the light fades across the ceiling, and the placement of the lines in the composition.  Beautiful work.  10</td>', 'I positively love abstract work and I think that you''ve "seen" this in a brilliant way and captured it well.  I love the monochrome feel, the way the light fades across the ceiling, and the placement of the lines in the composition.  Beautiful work.  10', '2003-06-09 13:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(319680, 24102, 7857, '<td valign="top">Certainly nothing I can write here in order to suggest improvements, great job. Good luck with it.</td>', 'Certainly nothing I can write here in order to suggest improvements, great job. Good luck with it.', '2003-06-09 13:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(319682, 23799, 5391, '<td valign="top">Captures the essense of the challenge very well and technically very well done.  Beautiful work.  10</td>', 'Captures the essense of the challenge very well and technically very well done.  Beautiful work.  10', '2003-06-09 13:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(319685, 24256, 7857, '<td valign="top">Reallt like this shot, its a pencil lead holder? How small is it? Nice lighting, the base you''ve got it on too has a nice texture and colour. Great job. Mitonski</td>', 'Reallt like this shot, its a pencil lead holder? How small is it? Nice lighting, the base you''ve got it on too has a nice texture and colour. Great job. Mitonski', '2003-06-09 13:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(319688, 24097, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Possibly, imho, the most creative idea of the challenge.  The message jumps out at you and communicates effectively.  Technically well executed, good dynamic composition.  Grea t work.  10</td>', 'Very well done.  Possibly, imho, the most creative idea of the challenge.  The message jumps out at you and communicates effectively.  Technically well executed, good dynamic composition.  Grea t work.  10', '2003-06-09 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(319690, 24102, 5391, '<td valign="top">Extremely well done.  Creative, good graphic image with eye-catching saturated colors.  Very "officey", as well as interesting to look at.  9</td>', 'Extremely well done.  Creative, good graphic image with eye-catching saturated colors.  Very "officey", as well as interesting to look at.  9', '2003-06-09 13:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
