(319697, 24232, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very good idea!  The place where I buy gas tapes plastic spoons to his pens so no one will run off with them.  I admit that I''m a klepto at times.  I like your lighting in this picture and nice detail, especially of the pen cup and pink rose.  It could be my monitor but it''s hard to see the red rose.  7  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very good idea!  The place where I buy gas tapes plastic spoons to his pens so no one will run off with them.  I admit that I''m a klepto at times.  I like your lighting in this picture and nice detail, especially of the pen cup and pink rose.  It could be my monitor but it''s hard to see the red rose.  7  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-06-09 13:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(319698, 24265, 9253, '<td valign="top">Excellent.</td>', 'Excellent.', '2003-06-09 13:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(319700, 23799, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, the blue tint is very fitting, good luck with it.</td>', 'Nice picture, the blue tint is very fitting, good luck with it.', '2003-06-09 13:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(319701, 23992, 5391, '<td valign="top">This is really good.  I love the "landscape" you''ve created with these silhouettes.  The only tiny nit-pick I have is the object of the right side seems to be a bit soft in terms of focus, while the rest of the image is tack-sharp.  I wish I''d thought of something this clever for my entry!  9</td>', 'This is really good.  I love the "landscape" you''ve created with these silhouettes.  The only tiny nit-pick I have is the object of the right side seems to be a bit soft in terms of focus, while the rest of the image is tack-sharp.  I wish I''d thought of something this clever for my entry!  9', '2003-06-09 13:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(319702, 23945, 7857, '<td valign="top">Seems to me that theres too much negative space... Did you try any other cropping? Maybe a tighter crop would look good, or if it were done in macro and a nice close up on the calculator and disc.</td>', 'Seems to me that theres too much negative space... Did you try any other cropping? Maybe a tighter crop would look good, or if it were done in macro and a nice close up on the calculator and disc.', '2003-06-09 13:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(319704, 24233, 3669, '<td valign="top">You had a real unique idea here.  I do think, however, the paperclips could have been place a little better.  I don''t really have any quick ideas to offer, but it just doesn''t seem to appeal to me.  Could have done without the diagonal line I think.  Otherwise you focus is good.</td>', 'You had a real unique idea here.  I do think, however, the paperclips could have been place a little better.  I don''t really have any quick ideas to offer, but it just doesn''t seem to appeal to me.  Could have done without the diagonal line I think.  Otherwise you focus is good.', '2003-06-09 13:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(319708, 24263, 7857, '<td valign="top">I think this would have made a nicer abstract if you had cropped out the vertical shadowed area towards the bottom of this. Other than that it''s a really nice picture. Good job</td>', 'I think this would have made a nicer abstract if you had cropped out the vertical shadowed area towards the bottom of this. Other than that it''s a really nice picture. Good job', '2003-06-09 13:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(319710, 24272, 4400, '<td valign="top">need better focus</td>', 'need better focus', '2003-06-09 13:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(319711, 24220, 5391, '<td valign="top">I like that this conveys a message and I hope people don''t miss out and score lower than it deserves because they miss the clever subtlety.  A less centered composition would have gotten a higher score from me, but it''s still so clever that it''s an 8.  Nice work.</td>', 'I like that this conveys a message and I hope people don''t miss out and score lower than it deserves because they miss the clever subtlety.  A less centered composition would have gotten a higher score from me, but it''s still so clever that it''s an 8.  Nice work.', '2003-06-09 13:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(319713, 24238, 7857, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot IMO, sort of a nice minimalist image, the lighting is great, and the purple reflection complements the colour of the pen (is this the natural colour or tweaked hues?)</td>', 'This is a really nice shot IMO, sort of a nice minimalist image, the lighting is great, and the purple reflection complements the colour of the pen (is this the natural colour or tweaked hues?)', '2003-06-09 13:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(319714, 24031, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - I''ve never seen a junk drawer look so appealing!!  Great composition, the way it carries your eye all through the image and makes you want to keep looking in each little cubby hole.  8</td>', 'Wow - I''ve never seen a junk drawer look so appealing!!  Great composition, the way it carries your eye all through the image and makes you want to keep looking in each little cubby hole.  8', '2003-06-09 13:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(319716, 24238, 5391, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot for its pure simplicity, nice composition and overall sharpness.  Nice work!  9</td>', 'I like this a lot for its pure simplicity, nice composition and overall sharpness.  Nice work!  9', '2003-06-09 13:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(319717, 24108, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, the blue clip inter-twined with the steel ones is very nice. Possibly a different BG colour? lol though I don''t know what colour would look good, maybe red, did you try any others?</td>', 'Nice picture, the blue clip inter-twined with the steel ones is very nice. Possibly a different BG colour? lol though I don''t know what colour would look good, maybe red, did you try any others?', '2003-06-09 13:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
