(319731, 23645, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... its nice the staples at the front are in focus, but a shame you couldnt get the whole of the remover in focus. Good lighting, nice idea.</td>', 'Nice shot... its nice the staples at the front are in focus, but a shame you couldnt get the whole of the remover in focus. Good lighting, nice idea.', '2003-06-09 14:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
