(319744, 24264, 9185, '<td valign="top">This is cool!</td>', 'This is cool!', '2003-06-09 14:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(319745, 24247, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice shot here, there are a lot of B+W''s in this challenge but they all look great (give them a classy touch I feel). You really caught the smooth texture of the surface here which is nice... given by your title it''d be interesting to see what it normally looks like!! Good luck with it. Mitonski</td>', 'Nice shot here, there are a lot of B+W''s in this challenge but they all look great (give them a classy touch I feel). You really caught the smooth texture of the surface here which is nice... given by your title it''d be interesting to see what it normally looks like!! Good luck with it. Mitonski', '2003-06-09 14:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(319746, 23992, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice take on the challenge.  I really liked your idea to back light your subjects.  I like the paperclip flower, but couldn''t figure out what the rest was.  I suppose that''s a tape despenser, but where''s the tape?  Well focused 7</td>', 'Very nice take on the challenge.  I really liked your idea to back light your subjects.  I like the paperclip flower, but couldn''t figure out what the rest was.  I suppose that''s a tape despenser, but where''s the tape?  Well focused 7', '2003-06-09 14:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(319747, 23728, 7857, '<td valign="top">White beer, not my preference but everyone to their own. Nice shot, very fitting, expecially the game on the palm top instead of work. Good luck with this one, its a great shot.</td>', 'White beer, not my preference but everyone to their own. Nice shot, very fitting, expecially the game on the palm top instead of work. Good luck with this one, its a great shot.', '2003-06-09 14:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(319752, 24198, 7857, '<td valign="top">Excellent title, excellent concept, relly brings out the fang qualities of the staple remover... perhaps if you had some "carcases" of staples you removed from somehting lying next to it? That might look pretty funky. My only gripe - A bit more of the whole set-up in focus would have been nice. Good luck with this one. Mitonski</td>', 'Excellent title, excellent concept, relly brings out the fang qualities of the staple remover... perhaps if you had some "carcases" of staples you removed from somehting lying next to it? That might look pretty funky. My only gripe - A bit more of the whole set-up in focus would have been nice. Good luck with this one. Mitonski', '2003-06-09 14:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(319753, 24088, 3669, '<td valign="top">I think that this would have been a nice picture without the coffee cup.  I like the texture of the background and the placement of the pencils in the holder.  The coffee cup just doesn''t seem to fit and appears ackward to me.</td>', 'I think that this would have been a nice picture without the coffee cup.  I like the texture of the background and the placement of the pencils in the holder.  The coffee cup just doesn''t seem to fit and appears ackward to me.', '2003-06-09 14:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
