(319759, 23972, 7857, '<td valign="top">A little uninteresting to me... perhaps if you''d rotated so either the keys were in a straight line, or gone the opposite way so it was an extreme slant. Also, macro shot could look good here.</td>', 'A little uninteresting to me... perhaps if you''d rotated so either the keys were in a straight line, or gone the opposite way so it was an extreme slant. Also, macro shot could look good here.', '2003-06-09 14:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(319761, 24231, 3669, '<td valign="top">I immediately wanted to turn my head to see what I was looking at.  Did you mean for it to be laid out horizontal?  Your focus and lighting are great and you do meet challenge.  It just doesn''t appeal to me much.  5</td>', 'I immediately wanted to turn my head to see what I was looking at.  Did you mean for it to be laid out horizontal?  Your focus and lighting are great and you do meet challenge.  It just doesn''t appeal to me much.  5', '2003-06-09 14:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(319762, 24216, 7857, '<td valign="top">Wow, this must have taken a while to set up. Nice idea, I would have liked to see more of the notes in focus though. Good luck with it. Mitonski</td>', 'Wow, this must have taken a while to set up. Nice idea, I would have liked to see more of the notes in focus though. Good luck with it. Mitonski', '2003-06-09 14:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
