(319766, 24026, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very cute idea.  What hurts you, though is the busy background.  Perhaps a more neurtral background and surface would have been more appropriate.  4  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very cute idea.  What hurts you, though is the busy background.  Perhaps a more neurtral background and surface would have been more appropriate.  4  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-06-09 14:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(319767, 24198, 4493, '<td valign="top">Howdee,<br/> <br/>This is a fine image that is technically fine. There are no obvious flaws or distractions. I feel that it lacks something that captures the viewers attention. The lines of the staples are competeing with the staple remover. This keeps the eye bouncing around the screen trying to find a central object to focus on. The background although not distracting doesn''t add any feel to this shot. There is no color to add drama. Some red underneath would have given the viewer the feeling of the attack. That coupled with maybe just the one row of staples with a different camera angle would have pulled this all together for a stronger image. -danny</td>', 'Howdee, This is a fine image that is technically fine. There are no obvious flaws or distractions. I feel that it lacks something that captures the viewers attention. The lines of the staples are competeing with the staple remover. This keeps the eye bouncing around the screen trying to find a central object to focus on. The background although not distracting doesn''t add any feel to this shot. There is no color to add drama. Some red underneath would have given the viewer the feeling of the attack. That coupled with maybe just the one row of staples with a different camera angle would have pulled this all together for a stronger image. -danny', '2003-06-09 14:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(319768, 24138, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, the different levels of the pens looks great too. Background is good... I can certainly imagine this hanging in an office. Good luck with it.</td>', 'Nice idea, the different levels of the pens looks great too. Background is good... I can certainly imagine this hanging in an office. Good luck with it.', '2003-06-09 14:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(319770, 24099, 7857, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Nice lighting, nice focus (kinda soft) and the colour is great. Good luck. Mitonski</td>', 'I really like this shot. Nice lighting, nice focus (kinda soft) and the colour is great. Good luck. Mitonski', '2003-06-09 14:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(319772, 24187, 3669, '<td valign="top">Really, at first I thought I was looking at a lamp with one of those bendy necks.  Anyway, looking at your title set me straight.  The red background with the black mouse is nice.  I just don''t like the lit scroller.  It takes away from your color theme and seems to not fit.  8  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Really, at first I thought I was looking at a lamp with one of those bendy necks.  Anyway, looking at your title set me straight.  The red background with the black mouse is nice.  I just don''t like the lit scroller.  It takes away from your color theme and seems to not fit.  8  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-06-09 14:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(319773, 24041, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, the sepia looks good, DOF nice also. No improvements I can suggest, good job.</td>', 'Nice macro, the sepia looks good, DOF nice also. No improvements I can suggest, good job.', '2003-06-09 14:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(319774, 24230, 3669, '<td valign="top">Hey!!  I used to do this as a kid!!  I can see where some bored secretary on a quiet day could get carried away, so I guess it meets challenge.  I don''t like how the paperclips don''t really stand out.  The skin tone seems very washed out.  Perhaps this would have been better in color where you would have natural skin tone.  That''s just my thoughts 4  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hey!!  I used to do this as a kid!!  I can see where some bored secretary on a quiet day could get carried away, so I guess it meets challenge.  I don''t like how the paperclips don''t really stand out.  The skin tone seems very washed out.  Perhaps this would have been better in color where you would have natural skin tone.  That''s just my thoughts 4  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-06-09 14:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(319776, 24025, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very cute cup.  I like your color theme here.  The green ribbon on the handle kind of distracts from those colors.  The angle also appears a little ackward here.  Too uniform for my taste.  5 Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very cute cup.  I like your color theme here.  The green ribbon on the handle kind of distracts from those colors.  The angle also appears a little ackward here.  Too uniform for my taste.  5 Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-06-09 14:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(319780, 24043, 3669, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, fax machine face.  Lets see...I know this seems a little nit picky but I would have liked to see the green button more in the bottom corner and could have gotten just a little more blue at the top.  I like your use of DOF.  I really like the colors.  They are vivid.  8  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ahhh, fax machine face.  Lets see...I know this seems a little nit picky but I would have liked to see the green button more in the bottom corner and could have gotten just a little more blue at the top.  I like your use of DOF.  I really like the colors.  They are vivid.  8  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-06-09 14:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(319783, 24268, 7857, '<td valign="top">Its a nice abstract... moudling from office ceiling? Little bit bland, but nice.</td>', 'Its a nice abstract... moudling from office ceiling? Little bit bland, but nice.', '2003-06-09 14:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(319784, 24246, 7038, '<td valign="top">Really like this pic, good composition and like how some of the shavings are hanging over the frame.</td>', 'Really like this pic, good composition and like how some of the shavings are hanging over the frame.', '2003-06-09 14:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(319785, 23843, 7038, '<td valign="top">An ok pic, but i don''t see this as meeting the challenge, unless im missing something<br/></td>', 'An ok pic, but i don''t see this as meeting the challenge, unless im missing something', '2003-06-09 14:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(319787, 24239, 3669, '<td valign="top">Quite a contrast between your subject and the background.  Maybe if I knew what I was looking at, I could vote on this better.  The shadow is interesting.  The background just seem inappropriate for the purple plastic thingy.  Up picked up the texture of the table nicely.  You can see the grain and scratches of a well worn surface.  Don''t know what else to say.  4  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Quite a contrast between your subject and the background.  Maybe if I knew what I was looking at, I could vote on this better.  The shadow is interesting.  The background just seem inappropriate for the purple plastic thingy.  Up picked up the texture of the table nicely.  You can see the grain and scratches of a well worn surface.  Don''t know what else to say.  4  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-06-09 14:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(319790, 24260, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, shame none of the tops are in focus to see what brand it its, or maybe its easy to tell if you from there. Very nice, fitting title, good luck with it.</td>', 'Nice shot, shame none of the tops are in focus to see what brand it its, or maybe its easy to tell if you from there. Very nice, fitting title, good luck with it.', '2003-06-09 14:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(319791, 24002, 3669, '<td valign="top">This is a fun picture.  We used to do this as kids to make bouncy balls.  Takes a long time to build a good one.  Lighting is appropriate.  Usually I don''t like exact centered subject matters, but this one is good.  I like the DOF you used.  Nice detail of the rubber bands.  9  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a fun picture.  We used to do this as kids to make bouncy balls.  Takes a long time to build a good one.  Lighting is appropriate.  Usually I don''t like exact centered subject matters, but this one is good.  I like the DOF you used.  Nice detail of the rubber bands.  9  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-06-09 14:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(319792, 23945, 3669, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of subject matter.  I''m not sure as I like the lighting.  Seems a little washed out.  Also, I think a tighter crop would be appropriate for this.  Good luck in the challenge  5</td>', 'Interesting choice of subject matter.  I''m not sure as I like the lighting.  Seems a little washed out.  Also, I think a tighter crop would be appropriate for this.  Good luck in the challenge  5', '2003-06-09 14:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(319794, 24231, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, unusual objects to rest the pen on... they are? Nice colour, nice set up. Good luck with it. Mitonski</td>', 'Nice picture, unusual objects to rest the pen on... they are? Nice colour, nice set up. Good luck with it. Mitonski', '2003-06-09 14:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(319796, 24202, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject choice.  I like the reflection and the different views of the sign on the balls.  The ball on the left should be turn just slightly to the right, however.  Are these paper weights?...if not, I''m not sure I would say it was office art.  By the way, I do like the picture.  I just think this would be better cropped to the balls on both sides to make a square photo.  6  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very interesting subject choice.  I like the reflection and the different views of the sign on the balls.  The ball on the left should be turn just slightly to the right, however.  Are these paper weights?...if not, I''m not sure I would say it was office art.  By the way, I do like the picture.  I just think this would be better cropped to the balls on both sides to make a square photo.  6  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-06-09 14:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(319798, 24026, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, nice concept, stapler vs remover. I also like that its not done on a kind of studio backdrop... this way gives it a much more real feeling. Good luck</td>', 'Nice picture, nice concept, stapler vs remover. I also like that its not done on a kind of studio backdrop... this way gives it a much more real feeling. Good luck', '2003-06-09 14:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(319799, 24259, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice and colourful, did you sit and make this just for this challenge? Nice spot lighting, good sharp focus, good luck with it. Mitonski</td>', 'Nice and colourful, did you sit and make this just for this challenge? Nice spot lighting, good sharp focus, good luck with it. Mitonski', '2003-06-09 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(319801, 24230, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, I like the way her top blends right into the background... shes got them in both ears? Seems like I can just see the other side, maybe its my monitor. All in all a very nice shot. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice picture, I like the way her top blends right into the background... shes got them in both ears? Seems like I can just see the other side, maybe its my monitor. All in all a very nice shot. Good luck.', '2003-06-09 15:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(319803, 23992, 7857, '<td valign="top">Cluttered but very nice. Can''t figure out what the round thing is, erm or even the thing on the right. Good shot, hope you do well with it.</td>', 'Cluttered but very nice. Can''t figure out what the round thing is, erm or even the thing on the right. Good shot, hope you do well with it.', '2003-06-09 15:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(319805, 24202, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, ice positioning, good colours. Hope you do well.</td>', 'Nice idea, ice positioning, good colours. Hope you do well.', '2003-06-09 15:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(319815, 23843, 4400, '<td valign="top">office art? ar you meteorologist:O)</td>', 'office art? ar you meteorologist:O)', '2003-06-09 15:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(319824, 23948, 5391, '<td valign="top">The really interesting lighting combined with the cool green color complimenting the warm wood really makes this image.  Cute idea.  8</td>', 'The really interesting lighting combined with the cool green color complimenting the warm wood really makes this image.  Cute idea.  8', '2003-06-09 15:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(319825, 24143, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very good abstract.  Interesting, dynamic composition.  8</td>', 'Very good abstract.  Interesting, dynamic composition.  8', '2003-06-09 15:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(319832, 24006, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very cool use of three-dimensional objects to make a two-dimensional image.  Great technique not often utilized by photographers.  I''d perhaps like it if all the objects were the same color or something to tie it all together compositionally, but overall your idea is great!  Congrats on the originality.</td>', 'Very cool use of three-dimensional objects to make a two-dimensional image.  Great technique not often utilized by photographers.  I''d perhaps like it if all the objects were the same color or something to tie it all together compositionally, but overall your idea is great!  Congrats on the originality.', '2003-06-09 15:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(319935, 24185, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very precise photo, except the right edge of the pencil (??).  Nice use of 1/3 rule.  Nice reflection.  All that said, it''s not got a lot of WOW factor.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very precise photo, except the right edge of the pencil (??).  Nice use of 1/3 rule.  Nice reflection.  All that said, it''s not got a lot of WOW factor.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-09 18:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(319940, 24204, 1005, '<td valign="top">The sign is pretty clear, but the glare from the window overpowers much of the image (even the sign).  The subject seems to be the toy in the background (see title), but the focus says the sign is the subject.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'The sign is pretty clear, but the glare from the window overpowers much of the image (even the sign).  The subject seems to be the toy in the background (see title), but the focus says the sign is the subject.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-09 18:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(319947, 23925, 6893, '<td valign="top">As usual you have done a marvolous job in capturing what should be the light heartednes of the work space.</td>', 'As usual you have done a marvolous job in capturing what should be the light heartednes of the work space.', '2003-06-09 18:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(320005, 24202, 9262, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the ball on the left is a little close to the top of the image though!</td>', 'Nice shot, the ball on the left is a little close to the top of the image though!', '2003-06-09 19:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
