(320042, 24108, 9262, '<td valign="top">nice shot, good lighting and composition.</td>', 'nice shot, good lighting and composition.', '2003-06-09 20:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(320043, 24099, 4564, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Well executed.  Simple, yet efficient.</td>', 'Nice composition. Well executed.  Simple, yet efficient.', '2003-06-09 20:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(320045, 23972, 9262, '<td valign="top">blurred and overexposed. the angling is distracting.</td>', 'blurred and overexposed. the angling is distracting.', '2003-06-09 20:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(320047, 24230, 9262, '<td valign="top">great idea, nice shot. Looks a little overexposed.</td>', 'great idea, nice shot. Looks a little overexposed.', '2003-06-09 20:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(320050, 24102, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cool, colorful shot!  Love the droplet reflections, very nice!  10 Swash</td>', 'Very cool, colorful shot!  Love the droplet reflections, very nice!  10 Swash', '2003-06-09 20:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(320052, 24268, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very subtle photo.  Nice shapes and flow, but not much to grab me and hold me as a viewer.  Very sharp.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very subtle photo.  Nice shapes and flow, but not much to grab me and hold me as a viewer.  Very sharp.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-09 20:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(320057, 24232, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well taken photo!  I am amazed at how well the white rose shows up against the white background, that said, I would suggest a more contrasting background color.  Very sharp.  (tongue firmly planted in cheek - does the plastic roses have plastic thorns?)  The pen/rose on the table doesn''t seem like a good angle for viewing.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very well taken photo!  I am amazed at how well the white rose shows up against the white background, that said, I would suggest a more contrasting background color.  Very sharp.  (tongue firmly planted in cheek - does the plastic roses have plastic thorns?)  The pen/rose on the table doesn''t seem like a good angle for viewing.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-09 20:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(320058, 23994, 1005, '<td valign="top">Silly, but kinda lacks the "art" part.  Flash pretty good on the person in front, but not quite strong enough for the person in back (plus nasty shadows...).  A bit of glare on the IR mouse.  (Man in pink shirt needs to button both cuff buttons!)  <br/>7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Silly, but kinda lacks the "art" part.  Flash pretty good on the person in front, but not quite strong enough for the person in back (plus nasty shadows...).  A bit of glare on the IR mouse.  (Man in pink shirt needs to button both cuff buttons!)  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-09 20:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(320062, 24031, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good focus.  (size 11 xacto blades)  Watch your lighting, a bit glaring on the left and a bit weak on the right.  No surprises, nothing really draws me into this photo (no WOW).  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice shot, good focus.  (size 11 xacto blades)  Watch your lighting, a bit glaring on the left and a bit weak on the right.  No surprises, nothing really draws me into this photo (no WOW).  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-09 20:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(320063, 24230, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sharp photo, but low contrast between her skin the the paper clips.  Photo seems a tad bit grainy, esp. the upper neck area.  (backspaced color idea)  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Sharp photo, but low contrast between her skin the the paper clips.  Photo seems a tad bit grainy, esp. the upper neck area.  (backspaced color idea)  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-09 20:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(320064, 24041, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sharp photo/dramatic angle with good lighting (no glare spots, but very visible, nicely done).  I''m not seeing what I''d call art, more like office supplies...very little WOW factor for me.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Sharp photo/dramatic angle with good lighting (no glare spots, but very visible, nicely done).  I''m not seeing what I''d call art, more like office supplies...very little WOW factor for me.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-09 20:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(320065, 24274, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very sharp photo.  A little glare, but otherwise good lighting.  Good angle for subject.  Not as much art as office supply, very low "WOW" factor.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very sharp photo.  A little glare, but otherwise good lighting.  Good angle for subject.  Not as much art as office supply, very low "WOW" factor.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-09 20:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(320066, 24233, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very sharp photo!  Nice color.  Image leaves with lots of questions - why the paper line down the middle (and the circle...could these be water marks)?  Why colorful paperclips in one corner and bland ones in the other?  This photo has a better "WOW" factor than the pics I gave a 7 to so, score upgrade to 8.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very sharp photo!  Nice color.  Image leaves with lots of questions - why the paper line down the middle (and the circle...could these be water marks)?  Why colorful paperclips in one corner and bland ones in the other?  This photo has a better "WOW" factor than the pics I gave a 7 to so, score upgrade to 8.  Rob the Swash', '2003-06-09 20:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(320068, 24097, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sharp photo and a cute idea (hits home for me!)  I think I see why the newspaper (stock market?), but maybe the help wanted section would have driven this home better.  Low "art", more centered on office supplies.  Very little "WOW" for me.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Sharp photo and a cute idea (hits home for me!)  I think I see why the newspaper (stock market?), but maybe the help wanted section would have driven this home better.  Low "art", more centered on office supplies.  Very little "WOW" for me.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-06-09 20:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
