(320608, 24216, 3669, '<td valign="top">Have you seen the movie \"Bruce Almighty\"?  Funny movie and this reminds me of one of the scenes.  Must have taken you awhile to set this shot up with all the \"Post-It\" notes.  Very unique and a good take on the challenge.  The only thing about is, though, it seems a bit blaa.  It would have taken a lot longer to set up, but maybe putting messages on the notes would have been nice.   5 Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Have you seen the movie \"Bruce Almighty\"?  Funny movie and this reminds me of one of the scenes.  Must have taken you awhile to set this shot up with all the \"Post-It\" notes.  Very unique and a good take on the challenge.  The only thing about is, though, it seems a bit blaa.  It would have taken a lot longer to set up, but maybe putting messages on the notes would have been nice.   5 Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-06-10 12:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(320612, 24247, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice angle shot on the subject matter.  I think I actually would have liked to see this office picture more cluttered.  Seems like a vacant work space.  No family pictures.  Otherwise, it is technically a well done photo.</td>', 'Nice angle shot on the subject matter.  I think I actually would have liked to see this office picture more cluttered.  Seems like a vacant work space.  No family pictures.  Otherwise, it is technically a well done photo.', '2003-06-10 12:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
