(322293, 24230, 7711, '<td valign="top">this reminds me of those classic "debeers" diamond ads. What a great and creative way to meet the challenge. I love the bw treatment, its utterly classic. Contrast is a bit high as parts of her skin look a tad blown, but otherwise, very cool!</td>', 'this reminds me of those classic "debeers" diamond ads. What a great and creative way to meet the challenge. I love the bw treatment, its utterly classic. Contrast is a bit high as parts of her skin look a tad blown, but otherwise, very cool!', '2003-06-11 14:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(322294, 23719, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting clutter.  lol  Looks a bit too much for me.  But great job meeting the challenge!</td>', 'Interesting clutter.  lol  Looks a bit too much for me.  But great job meeting the challenge!', '2003-06-11 14:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(322304, 24108, 7711, '<td valign="top">i like the inclusion of the blue paperclip to add a flash of colour to the cold "steel" of the paperclips. Border is a bit heavy though, it is really competing for attention.</td>', 'i like the inclusion of the blue paperclip to add a flash of colour to the cold "steel" of the paperclips. Border is a bit heavy though, it is really competing for attention.', '2003-06-11 14:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(322310, 24216, 7711, '<td valign="top">Nice use of light and shadow to create an interesting patterned composition. I would have liked the yellows to be a bit brighter and more saturated, but these notes are usually this pale colour, so you were true to life! Well done. <br/> <br/>PS: I hope you recycled all those stickynotes after!</td>', 'Nice use of light and shadow to create an interesting patterned composition. I would have liked the yellows to be a bit brighter and more saturated, but these notes are usually this pale colour, so you were true to life! Well done.  PS: I hope you recycled all those stickynotes after!', '2003-06-11 14:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(322313, 23962, 7711, '<td valign="top">looks more like a hole punch, but what do I know? :) Nice simple composition, but a little more negative space to the right would have punched it up a tad (rule of thirds sort of thing), no? :) Just an idea!</td>', 'looks more like a hole punch, but what do I know? :) Nice simple composition, but a little more negative space to the right would have punched it up a tad (rule of thirds sort of thing), no? :) Just an idea!', '2003-06-11 14:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
