(323044, 23908, 2000, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge, and in very nice fashion.  The title, however, is quite pun-ishing.  The lighting is a bit weird to me - i can''t quite put my finger on it, but it may be that I''m used to silver paper clips, and either the lighting or clips themselves are bronze/copper colored.  I see also that you took the time to connect all of these clips.</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge, and in very nice fashion.  The title, however, is quite pun-ishing.  The lighting is a bit weird to me - i can''t quite put my finger on it, but it may be that I''m used to silver paper clips, and either the lighting or clips themselves are bronze/copper colored.  I see also that you took the time to connect all of these clips.', '2003-06-12 00:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(323104, 24272, 8131, '<td valign="top">This ''Office Art'' photo jumped at me the first viewing round I gave the selections and stayed with me throughout the entire viewing time. Different to say the least; unique and certainly a given for the first ''Office Art "Coffee Table" Book''.</td>', 'This ''Office Art'' photo jumped at me the first viewing round I gave the selections and stayed with me throughout the entire viewing time. Different to say the least; unique and certainly a given for the first ''Office Art "Coffee Table" Book''.', '2003-06-12 01:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
