(323488, 24202, 3540, '<td valign="top">This one needs some real breathing room.  The crop is just too tight.  I like the idea.  Someone here at work actually has a set the same or similar to this.  The reflections are good too.   This shot definitely works, except that it needs a little more room.</td>', 'This one needs some real breathing room.  The crop is just too tight.  I like the idea.  Someone here at work actually has a set the same or similar to this.  The reflections are good too.   This shot definitely works, except that it needs a little more room.', '2003-06-12 13:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(323489, 24275, 3540, '<td valign="top">This one is suffering from some serious image problems.  Or, you have chosen to give it these problems.  Seems like these darn things keep showing up in challenges.  When I need one for my office though they are nowhere to be found.   This photo has a real overprocessed look to it for one reason or another.  Regardless of the reason, it is irreversibly distracting to the photo, and detracting from the overall image quality and visual impact.</td>', 'This one is suffering from some serious image problems.  Or, you have chosen to give it these problems.  Seems like these darn things keep showing up in challenges.  When I need one for my office though they are nowhere to be found.   This photo has a real overprocessed look to it for one reason or another.  Regardless of the reason, it is irreversibly distracting to the photo, and detracting from the overall image quality and visual impact.', '2003-06-12 13:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(323491, 24100, 3540, '<td valign="top">The roll of tape is not really helping things in the picture.  This might have been better if you didn''t show the bottom of the cup, or the bottom of the screen behind it.  You really lose the illusion of the paperclips in motion knowing that the screen is immediately behind the cup.  If we couldn''t see that at the bottom, it would be a better sell.  Its a good idea, and this picture would''ve worked if you cropped off the bottom.  I know why you didn''t (the paperclips on the table),  but I think weighing out the pluses and minuses,  it would''ve been more conducive to cut it off</td>', 'The roll of tape is not really helping things in the picture.  This might have been better if you didn''t show the bottom of the cup, or the bottom of the screen behind it.  You really lose the illusion of the paperclips in motion knowing that the screen is immediately behind the cup.  If we couldn''t see that at the bottom, it would be a better sell.  Its a good idea, and this picture would''ve worked if you cropped off the bottom.  I know why you didn''t (the paperclips on the table),  but I think weighing out the pluses and minuses,  it would''ve been more conducive to cut it off', '2003-06-12 13:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(323493, 23945, 3540, '<td valign="top">THis image is very grainy and pixelating.  The colors look very off, however purposeful it was.  The bright spot at the bottom between the disk and the calculator is pretty distracting.</td>', 'THis image is very grainy and pixelating.  The colors look very off, however purposeful it was.  The bright spot at the bottom between the disk and the calculator is pretty distracting.', '2003-06-12 13:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(323495, 23992, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea.  One of the better photos of the challenge.  I like the silhouette of the "flower" but don''t really care for this stuff here on the left.  I think it might have been a little better with something a little more recognizable.</td>', 'This is a nice idea.  One of the better photos of the challenge.  I like the silhouette of the "flower" but don''t really care for this stuff here on the left.  I think it might have been a little better with something a little more recognizable.', '2003-06-12 14:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(323501, 24247, 7778, '<td valign="top">This photo appeals to me very much. The objects it depicts belong into the ''90s, the perspective is contemporary, the overall ''feel'' of it, to me, evokes the 1940s. Quite a range, in my book. Tonality is rich, detail preserved sufficiently and adequately for such a ''generic'' intent. <br/> <br/>I don''t know how to say it better, but the photo strikes me as ''pedantically precise'' in more than one way. The apparent order, meticulous cleanliness and exclusion of extranous objects are a joy to this soul. :-)<br/> <br/>Would you consider making a series of photographs in the same manner?</td>', 'This photo appeals to me very much. The objects it depicts belong into the ''90s, the perspective is contemporary, the overall ''feel'' of it, to me, evokes the 1940s. Quite a range, in my book. Tonality is rich, detail preserved sufficiently and adequately for such a ''generic'' intent.  I don''t know how to say it better, but the photo strikes me as ''pedantically precise'' in more than one way. The apparent order, meticulous cleanliness and exclusion of extranous objects are a joy to this soul. :-) Would you consider making a series of photographs in the same manner?', '2003-06-12 14:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(323506, 24125, 7778, '<td valign="top">The fitted (?) and rounded desk topis not credible! ;-)<br/> <br/>Wonderful time capsule you have created here. Technically, all seems appropiate to me, including the softer focus.</td>', 'The fitted (?) and rounded desk topis not credible! ;-) Wonderful time capsule you have created here. Technically, all seems appropiate to me, including the softer focus.', '2003-06-12 14:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(323519, 24006, 7711, '<td valign="top">some of the elements of the composition seem blown out, but very creative! :)</td>', 'some of the elements of the composition seem blown out, but very creative! :)', '2003-06-12 14:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(323520, 24230, 7778, '<td valign="top">Sometimes (!) I run into a photo with apparent flaws (contrast, lighting, focus...), when compared to the familar and usually sensible ways of photography.<br/> <br/>Here, IMO, we have a photograph that relies very little on any extraneous codec. Everything is as it should be. It is, in short, a photo to be studied and learnt from.<br/> <br/>The tension (dynamics) created between the ''frivolous'' clips, the dignified (sorrowful?) face (a ''telling'' mouth) and the hard and dry manner is what makes this an outstanding photo. The sculptural (bust-) effect achieved by blending the dress into the background and the very deliberate composition (the partial face) are extreme and cannot be done better.<br/> <br/>I bow.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Sometimes (!) I run into a photo with apparent flaws (contrast, lighting, focus...), when compared to the familar and usually sensible ways of photography. Here, IMO, we have a photograph that relies very little on any extraneous codec. Everything is as it should be. It is, in short, a photo to be studied and learnt from. The tension (dynamics) created between the ''frivolous'' clips, the dignified (sorrowful?) face (a ''telling'' mouth) and the hard and dry manner is what makes this an outstanding photo. The sculptural (bust-) effect achieved by blending the dress into the background and the very deliberate composition (the partial face) are extreme and cannot be done better. I bow. ', '2003-06-12 14:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
