(323961, 24232, 7556, '<td valign="top">I like the simple composition, nice clean shot...<br/>JB</td>', 'I like the simple composition, nice clean shot...JB', '2003-06-13 01:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(323964, 24102, 7556, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, beautiful...not to mention the reflecting drops...<br/>JB</td>', 'I love the colors, beautiful...not to mention the reflecting drops...JB', '2003-06-13 01:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(323967, 24246, 7556, '<td valign="top">Now thats art...very creative, nice shot...<br/>JB</td>', 'Now thats art...very creative, nice shot...JB', '2003-06-13 01:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(323973, 24252, 7556, '<td valign="top">Cool...I like the reflection, the blue background, the yellow &amp; orange/red borders, that pretty much covers it. great shot...<br/>JB</td>', 'Cool...I like the reflection, the blue background, the yellow & orange/red borders, that pretty much covers it. great shot...JB', '2003-06-13 01:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(323974, 23992, 7556, '<td valign="top">neat idea, good capture...<br/>JB</td>', 'neat idea, good capture...JB', '2003-06-13 01:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(323975, 24154, 7556, '<td valign="top">I like the brown tones &amp; the shadows, very nice...<br/>JB</td>', 'I like the brown tones & the shadows, very nice...JB', '2003-06-13 01:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(324219, 24259, 6740, '<td valign="top">Crystal clear image, like the lighting, and the rubberbands are not twisted so an A for effort and technique.</td>', 'Crystal clear image, like the lighting, and the rubberbands are not twisted so an A for effort and technique.', '2003-06-13 09:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(324226, 24138, 6740, '<td valign="top">Good choice. Very clear image with nice tones. Good luck in the voting</td>', 'Good choice. Very clear image with nice tones. Good luck in the voting', '2003-06-13 09:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(324227, 24099, 6740, '<td valign="top">Original photo which is very refreshing. 10</td>', 'Original photo which is very refreshing. 10', '2003-06-13 09:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(324228, 24046, 6740, '<td valign="top">What is not to like. Good luck in the voting.</td>', 'What is not to like. Good luck in the voting.', '2003-06-13 09:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(324362, 24216, 6059, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, vote it for a winner, this must score a lot.</td>', 'I love this shot, vote it for a winner, this must score a lot.', '2003-06-13 12:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(324363, 24143, 6900, '<td valign="top">I love shadows - if you want to get this one darker, move the light back further from the object.  The further away, the more "true" the shadow. :)</td>', 'I love shadows - if you want to get this one darker, move the light back further from the object.  The further away, the more "true" the shadow. :)', '2003-06-13 12:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(324364, 24220, 6900, '<td valign="top">Really liking this shot.  Nice diagonal composition and cropping - almost a tad too close on the right, but it''s good.  I like the lighting, with the PDA coming into focus and the calendar going out.</td>', 'Really liking this shot.  Nice diagonal composition and cropping - almost a tad too close on the right, but it''s good.  I like the lighting, with the PDA coming into focus and the calendar going out.', '2003-06-13 12:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(324366, 24275, 6900, '<td valign="top">Looks over processed or ... something.  I like the colors, but the technical feels wrong.  6</td>', 'Looks over processed or ... something.  I like the colors, but the technical feels wrong.  6', '2003-06-13 12:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(324367, 24246, 6900, '<td valign="top">One of the week''s best.  10</td>', 'One of the week''s best.  10', '2003-06-13 12:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(324374, 23992, 7504, '<td valign="top">This is so light-hearted, I just love it.  My favorite for the challenge, although, I think the paper-clip sculpture stands on it''s own, I''m not sure what the other two things are...I guess I''m kinda dense.  : )</td>', 'This is so light-hearted, I just love it.  My favorite for the challenge, although, I think the paper-clip sculpture stands on it''s own, I''m not sure what the other two things are...I guess I''m kinda dense.  : )', '2003-06-13 13:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(324376, 24187, 7504, '<td valign="top">Fun idea, and great title.  You''ve made the mouse look like some kind of surreal, futuristic device.  You''ve succeeded in making the mundane "art".</td>', 'Fun idea, and great title.  You''ve made the mouse look like some kind of surreal, futuristic device.  You''ve succeeded in making the mundane "art".', '2003-06-13 13:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(324378, 24202, 7504, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, perfect set-up, great idea.  The reflection is subtle and interesting.  I just think this is awesome, congrats!</td>', 'This is lovely, perfect set-up, great idea.  The reflection is subtle and interesting.  I just think this is awesome, congrats!', '2003-06-13 13:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(324381, 24154, 7504, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one, so I''m bumping up the score to a 9.  The shadows are beautiful and the lighting perfect for the moodiness of it.  Congrats!</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one, so I''m bumping up the score to a 9.  The shadows are beautiful and the lighting perfect for the moodiness of it.  Congrats!', '2003-06-13 13:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(324383, 24125, 7504, '<td valign="top">I like this so much.  Very emotive and sentimental.  The lighting is excellent as is your attention to detail.  Great job, I hope you do well!</td>', 'I like this so much.  Very emotive and sentimental.  The lighting is excellent as is your attention to detail.  Great job, I hope you do well!', '2003-06-13 13:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(324384, 23994, 7504, '<td valign="top">You know what, I really like this one!  There''s guys like this in every office, that''s for sure.  Don''t know if I''d call it "art" but I like it a lot!</td>', 'You know what, I really like this one!  There''s guys like this in every office, that''s for sure.  Don''t know if I''d call it "art" but I like it a lot!', '2003-06-13 13:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(324455, 24102, 8488, '<td valign="top">Wow. A 10. Gorgeous focus (both the sharps and the blurs - those markers in the background look like neon tubes!), and lovely high-contrast lighting.</td>', 'Wow. A 10. Gorgeous focus (both the sharps and the blurs - those markers in the background look like neon tubes!), and lovely high-contrast lighting.', '2003-06-13 15:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(324457, 24006, 8488, '<td valign="top">Definintely a ten from me, though admittedly it scores higher on concept than execution. :-&gt; The execution''s all right, but not Freaking Amazing. Concept is really, really cute, though.</td>', 'Definintely a ten from me, though admittedly it scores higher on concept than execution. :-> The execution''s all right, but not Freaking Amazing. Concept is really, really cute, though.', '2003-06-13 15:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(324458, 24256, 8488, '<td valign="top">Ow, wow. 9. It just pops for me, and technically I can find no real fault. I like the textured background (under-ground?); to me it adds more than a flat color would. The angle shooting down into the cube also lines up the varying circles in a way I find very appealing. If I had to nitpick anything I''d say that the bright bits of the insides of the bottom circles are maybe a *little* too bright for my tastes.</td>', 'Ow, wow. 9. It just pops for me, and technically I can find no real fault. I like the textured background (under-ground?); to me it adds more than a flat color would. The angle shooting down into the cube also lines up the varying circles in a way I find very appealing. If I had to nitpick anything I''d say that the bright bits of the insides of the bottom circles are maybe a *little* too bright for my tastes.', '2003-06-13 15:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(324459, 24275, 8488, '<td valign="top">Wow, a definite 9. I love the swirling saturated colors, and the transparancy (and reflection) of the body of the tack.</td>', 'Wow, a definite 9. I love the swirling saturated colors, and the transparancy (and reflection) of the body of the tack.', '2003-06-13 15:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(324460, 24216, 8488, '<td valign="top">A 9 from me. I love how it almost looks like a shingle-sided house.</td>', 'A 9 from me. I love how it almost looks like a shingle-sided house.', '2003-06-13 15:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(324461, 24259, 8488, '<td valign="top">A definite 9 from me; good colors, good lighting (good contrast with background), and something about the composition just makes it pop at me and want to be looked at. I bet people are going to complain about the texture on the bands, though. :-&gt;</td>', 'A definite 9 from me; good colors, good lighting (good contrast with background), and something about the composition just makes it pop at me and want to be looked at. I bet people are going to complain about the texture on the bands, though. :->', '2003-06-13 15:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(324463, 24230, 8488, '<td valign="top">A 9, though it could have been ten for me if it didn''t seem so blown-out, exposure-wise. As it is, it''s clinging to the bottom of nine with its fingernails, to me; however, the overall image is so appealing that I had to grade it up from 8 on beauty.</td>', 'A 9, though it could have been ten for me if it didn''t seem so blown-out, exposure-wise. As it is, it''s clinging to the bottom of nine with its fingernails, to me; however, the overall image is so appealing that I had to grade it up from 8 on beauty.', '2003-06-13 15:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(324464, 24187, 8488, '<td valign="top">9. I love the rich colors, the sensual curve of the cord, the appealing shapes of the negative space.</td>', '9. I love the rich colors, the sensual curve of the cord, the appealing shapes of the negative space.', '2003-06-13 15:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(324465, 24100, 8488, '<td valign="top">9 - very cute concept. :-&gt;</td>', '9 - very cute concept. :->', '2003-06-13 15:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(324466, 24098, 8488, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I just can''t shoehorn this into the topic. It''s a pretty shot, though (if grainy).</td>', 'Sorry, I just can''t shoehorn this into the topic. It''s a pretty shot, though (if grainy).', '2003-06-13 15:33:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(324468, 23960, 8488, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I just can''t shoehorn this into the topic. It''s a pretty shot, though; good colors. I''m a sucker for neon, myself; I have to exert willpower to not play with my camera and any neat sign I pass. :-&gt;</td>', 'Sorry, I just can''t shoehorn this into the topic. It''s a pretty shot, though; good colors. I''m a sucker for neon, myself; I have to exert willpower to not play with my camera and any neat sign I pass. :->', '2003-06-13 15:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(324469, 23843, 8488, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I just can''t shoehorn this into the topic, though I love it as an image.</td>', 'Sorry, I just can''t shoehorn this into the topic, though I love it as an image.', '2003-06-13 15:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(324470, 24204, 8488, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I just can''t shoehorn this into the topic.</td>', 'Sorry, I just can''t shoehorn this into the topic.', '2003-06-13 15:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(324471, 24102, 8377, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  This photo makes me think of office in a colorful way, instead of a drab, dull way.  This is one of my favorites this week.  I also love the fuzziness of the highlighters in the background, but then in the water drops, you can see them clearer.  And the dark outlines of the paper clips!  Wonderful idea.  Great job!</td>', 'I love this photo.  This photo makes me think of office in a colorful way, instead of a drab, dull way.  This is one of my favorites this week.  I also love the fuzziness of the highlighters in the background, but then in the water drops, you can see them clearer.  And the dark outlines of the paper clips!  Wonderful idea.  Great job!', '2003-06-13 15:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(324472, 24044, 8488, '<td valign="top">Fits the topic, but all the weird little white speckles all over it distract greatly, and the extreme contrast makes it hard to see. Good concept, bad execution, imho. 4.</td>', 'Fits the topic, but all the weird little white speckles all over it distract greatly, and the extreme contrast makes it hard to see. Good concept, bad execution, imho. 4.', '2003-06-13 15:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(324473, 24248, 8488, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I just can''t shoehorn this into the topic.</td>', 'Sorry, I just can''t shoehorn this into the topic.', '2003-06-13 15:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(324474, 23656, 8488, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I just can''t shoehorn this into the topic.</td>', 'Sorry, I just can''t shoehorn this into the topic.', '2003-06-13 15:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(324475, 24168, 8377, '<td valign="top">Even though it seems simple, I really like this photo.  It''s very clear and I like the cropping on it.  Also, on the subject matter, I think having those different colors of paper clips adds a bunch.  Good job</td>', 'Even though it seems simple, I really like this photo.  It''s very clear and I like the cropping on it.  Also, on the subject matter, I think having those different colors of paper clips adds a bunch.  Good job', '2003-06-13 15:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(324479, 24246, 8377, '<td valign="top">I love this one!  Very creative idea using a picture frame to frame the photo!  I love the shavings extending over onto the picture frame, that adds a lot to the photo.  The clarity of this photo is wonderful.  If I could vote, I would definitely give you a 9 or 10.</td>', 'I love this one!  Very creative idea using a picture frame to frame the photo!  I love the shavings extending over onto the picture frame, that adds a lot to the photo.  The clarity of this photo is wonderful.  If I could vote, I would definitely give you a 9 or 10.', '2003-06-13 15:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(324624, 24004, 8530, '<td valign="top">This is funny. I think larger type on the labels would have made it more a photo I''d actually envision wanting to hang on my cubicle or something (in the dual sense of ''office art'') but this one requires too close-up to make a good poster style thing.</td>', 'This is funny. I think larger type on the labels would have made it more a photo I''d actually envision wanting to hang on my cubicle or something (in the dual sense of ''office art'') but this one requires too close-up to make a good poster style thing.', '2003-06-13 18:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(324628, 24046, 8530, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if your relative devices are really that shade of blue (in which case, that''s neat, and where do I get the faceplates? :)) or if you tinted it (looks more likely overall) but either way it makes them very cool to look at. I like the idea in general. I''m kinda curious how it would look against a background that suggested something out of the office, but in this challenge it probably would have gotten your head handed to you. So, a neutral background is fine.</td>', 'I don''t know if your relative devices are really that shade of blue (in which case, that''s neat, and where do I get the faceplates? :)) or if you tinted it (looks more likely overall) but either way it makes them very cool to look at. I like the idea in general. I''m kinda curious how it would look against a background that suggested something out of the office, but in this challenge it probably would have gotten your head handed to you. So, a neutral background is fine.', '2003-06-13 18:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(324629, 24259, 8530, '<td valign="top">I had a feeling someone was going to do this. On the plus side, you have a lot of different colour rubber-bands, which makes it far more interesting to look at. And the framing is kinda cool, although it may be a bit too much negative space on the left.</td>', 'I had a feeling someone was going to do this. On the plus side, you have a lot of different colour rubber-bands, which makes it far more interesting to look at. And the framing is kinda cool, although it may be a bit too much negative space on the left.', '2003-06-13 18:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(324630, 23843, 8530, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if I see a connection to the challenge here with the possible exception of the lights looking like something one would find in a professional building''s parking lot. I realize some people took the topic as things you''d find hanging in an office but I disagree, so if that''s what you were going with we have an interpretation difference here.<br/> <br/>As far as the actual photo goes... I don''t know... the ''night falling'' part is fairly obvious, but the sky is so washed out that it''s kinda unattractive. More colour, or more interesting cloud formations, might have been nicer. Having the streetlamp over in the corner is, however, a good touch.</td>', 'I don''t know if I see a connection to the challenge here with the possible exception of the lights looking like something one would find in a professional building''s parking lot. I realize some people took the topic as things you''d find hanging in an office but I disagree, so if that''s what you were going with we have an interpretation difference here. As far as the actual photo goes... I don''t know... the ''night falling'' part is fairly obvious, but the sky is so washed out that it''s kinda unattractive. More colour, or more interesting cloud formations, might have been nicer. Having the streetlamp over in the corner is, however, a good touch.', '2003-06-13 18:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(324632, 23962, 8530, '<td valign="top">That''s a mighty strange-lookin'' stapler ya got there. <br/> <br/>I don''t know. I suppose as a minimalist piece it works. Of course, I''m not big into minimalism, but some people like it.</td>', 'That''s a mighty strange-lookin'' stapler ya got there.  I don''t know. I suppose as a minimalist piece it works. Of course, I''m not big into minimalism, but some people like it.', '2003-06-13 18:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(324633, 24102, 8016, '<td valign="top">very nice this may be your best photo yet. i like the way you use your imagination.</td>', 'very nice this may be your best photo yet. i like the way you use your imagination.', '2003-06-13 18:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(324635, 23861, 8530, '<td valign="top">This really does nothing for me, I''m afraid. I think I''d rather have seen the copier in action with paper or something more unusual (coffee mug? a kitten? yes, I''m weird) on top of it... eh.</td>', 'This really does nothing for me, I''m afraid. I think I''d rather have seen the copier in action with paper or something more unusual (coffee mug? a kitten? yes, I''m weird) on top of it... eh.', '2003-06-13 18:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(324637, 24088, 8530, '<td valign="top">Too intentionally arty for my personal tastes. An angle looking into the coffee cup to emphasize the liquid, or brighter lighting on the liquid, or leaving it colour, would have worked better with your title. I don''t care for how dim the lighting is on the objects being shown; it says ''abandoned'' to me, which may seem an odd thing to draw from it, but there ya have it.</td>', 'Too intentionally arty for my personal tastes. An angle looking into the coffee cup to emphasize the liquid, or brighter lighting on the liquid, or leaving it colour, would have worked better with your title. I don''t care for how dim the lighting is on the objects being shown; it says ''abandoned'' to me, which may seem an odd thing to draw from it, but there ya have it.', '2003-06-13 18:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(324638, 24274, 8530, '<td valign="top">Might make an interesting catalog photo. I question the choice of black and white but I''m just like that... still, as your subject is itself not something most people are going to spend a long time looking at, having it be bright and colourful might help.</td>', 'Might make an interesting catalog photo. I question the choice of black and white but I''m just like that... still, as your subject is itself not something most people are going to spend a long time looking at, having it be bright and colourful might help.', '2003-06-13 18:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(324642, 24108, 8530, '<td valign="top">I can''t call this ''abstract'' as obviously I know exactly what''s in the photo, but that was sort of the sense I got. I''m sure there''s a word for this I''m just forgetting because I''m not art-critic material. :)<br/> <br/>That having been said... I like the choice to include only a single coloured clip.</td>', 'I can''t call this ''abstract'' as obviously I know exactly what''s in the photo, but that was sort of the sense I got. I''m sure there''s a word for this I''m just forgetting because I''m not art-critic material. :) That having been said... I like the choice to include only a single coloured clip.', '2003-06-13 18:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(324643, 24264, 8530, '<td valign="top">More interesting in terms of topic than many office supplies, but I''m not sure about the tightness of focus; having so much blur foreground combined with the bright highlights detracts from the photo as a whole.</td>', 'More interesting in terms of topic than many office supplies, but I''m not sure about the tightness of focus; having so much blur foreground combined with the bright highlights detracts from the photo as a whole.', '2003-06-13 18:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(324644, 24262, 8016, '<td valign="top">very interesting photo i like the lamp in the background. you have to tell me how you got this photo.good luck in the challenge</td>', 'very interesting photo i like the lamp in the background. you have to tell me how you got this photo.good luck in the challenge', '2003-06-13 18:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(324648, 24100, 8530, '<td valign="top">Run for your lives! <br/> <br/>Heh. This made me smile -- definitely funny. I''m actually not sure if I like it with the tape dispenser but mostly I think because that''s the brightest colour in the photo -- maybe if it were a bit more of a muted tone. The eyes keep going to there away from the ''action'' of the shot.</td>', 'Run for your lives!  Heh. This made me smile -- definitely funny. I''m actually not sure if I like it with the tape dispenser but mostly I think because that''s the brightest colour in the photo -- maybe if it were a bit more of a muted tone. The eyes keep going to there away from the ''action'' of the shot.', '2003-06-13 18:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(324650, 23719, 8530, '<td valign="top">Not sure I agree with your title but I guess I get your point. Anyhow. Yeah, kind of interesting array of stuff, much better than a cubicle shot could''ve been by a long shot.</td>', 'Not sure I agree with your title but I guess I get your point. Anyhow. Yeah, kind of interesting array of stuff, much better than a cubicle shot could''ve been by a long shot.', '2003-06-13 18:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
