(325887, 24274, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice composition adds depth to the subject. Black and white gives attention to its form, which seems appropriate here. I find  your lighting less interesting than your other elements, but this is a straightforward "stock" photo of a stapler.</td>', 'Nice composition adds depth to the subject. Black and white gives attention to its form, which seems appropriate here. I find  your lighting less interesting than your other elements, but this is a straightforward "stock" photo of a stapler.', '2003-06-15 23:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(325890, 24025, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice still life arrangement; triangles work for me. The whole image seems inappropriately out of focus, just slightly. My attention certainly falls to the colorful pencils and pens in the mug.</td>', 'Nice still life arrangement; triangles work for me. The whole image seems inappropriately out of focus, just slightly. My attention certainly falls to the colorful pencils and pens in the mug.', '2003-06-15 23:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(325892, 24239, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here and the harsh lighting seems almost appropriate. I have no  idea what I''m looking at, though.</td>', 'I like the colors here and the harsh lighting seems almost appropriate. I have no  idea what I''m looking at, though.', '2003-06-15 23:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(325894, 24001, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of "negativity" in this photo. I''m not sure it adds much to your overall effect, which is surreal and dream like. Is this the effect you were going for?</td>', 'Interesting use of "negativity" in this photo. I''m not sure it adds much to your overall effect, which is surreal and dream like. Is this the effect you were going for?', '2003-06-15 23:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(325895, 23972, 6870, '<td valign="top">The slight tilt of the keyboard reallly helps add interest to this image. It seems slightly out of focus, though, and I think some more interesting lighting would add more drama and mood to the image, which would lead my thoughts beyond the photo, as it were, to think about deeper or broader things.</td>', 'The slight tilt of the keyboard reallly helps add interest to this image. It seems slightly out of focus, though, and I think some more interesting lighting would add more drama and mood to the image, which would lead my thoughts beyond the photo, as it were, to think about deeper or broader things.', '2003-06-15 23:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(325897, 23861, 6870, '<td valign="top">Intriguing light. It''s fun to see a unique light source being used! The composition works for me, too. The stapler doesn''t seem very sharply focused, though, and this detracts a tad from this lovely and inventive idea.</td>', 'Intriguing light. It''s fun to see a unique light source being used! The composition works for me, too. The stapler doesn''t seem very sharply focused, though, and this detracts a tad from this lovely and inventive idea.', '2003-06-15 23:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(325900, 23962, 6870, '<td valign="top">Your choice to put the stapler in the lower left third is interesting, and creates a feeling that the stapler can barely be contained. More dramatic or moody lighting would heighten this feeling even further.</td>', 'Your choice to put the stapler in the lower left third is interesting, and creates a feeling that the stapler can barely be contained. More dramatic or moody lighting would heighten this feeling even further.', '2003-06-15 23:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(325902, 24263, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines and patterns. Perhaps a closer point of view would provide a sense of mystery or drama to the shot.</td>', 'Interesting lines and patterns. Perhaps a closer point of view would provide a sense of mystery or drama to the shot.', '2003-06-15 23:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(325903, 24100, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and a fun shot. You might think about providing fun lighting or a unique perspective to enhance the feeling of whimsy and fun provided by the paper clips. Right now, they''re pretty much on their own.</td>', 'Clever idea and a fun shot. You might think about providing fun lighting or a unique perspective to enhance the feeling of whimsy and fun provided by the paper clips. Right now, they''re pretty much on their own.', '2003-06-15 23:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
