(326237, 24233, 2110, '<td valign="top">I like the style of your border but I guess the black is a little overpowering. Also I think when you are trying to compose like this symmetry is very important. If you had organized the clips on the left a little better, it would have brought the mirror magic in the image.<br/>Also I guess slightly reducing the amount of grey in the clips on the left would have balanced the frame better.<br/>Over all a nice attempt!!</td>', 'I like the style of your border but I guess the black is a little overpowering. Also I think when you are trying to compose like this symmetry is very important. If you had organized the clips on the left a little better, it would have brought the mirror magic in the image.Also I guess slightly reducing the amount of grey in the clips on the left would have balanced the frame better.Over all a nice attempt!!', '2003-06-16 05:34:00.000000', NULL, 0),
