(327618, 24125, 6202, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Stunning image, a well deserved win.  Your composition on this is outstanding.  This definately meets the challenge.  The seapia tones work well for this gives it that aged fill.  Your lighting on this makes it interesting. Wonderful dof and the focus is perfect for the image.  <br/> <br/>Very little I would change the only thing I see that might improve slightly is the glare on the desk edge from the light, and even that really isn''t all that much.  <br/> <br/>Very nicely done, congrats on the ribbon.<br/> <br/>Anna</td>', '*Critique Club* Stunning image, a well deserved win.  Your composition on this is outstanding.  This definately meets the challenge.  The seapia tones work well for this gives it that aged fill.  Your lighting on this makes it interesting. Wonderful dof and the focus is perfect for the image.   Very little I would change the only thing I see that might improve slightly is the glare on the desk edge from the light, and even that really isn''t all that much.   Very nicely done, congrats on the ribbon. Anna', '2003-06-17 10:10:07.000000', NULL, 0),
